                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJB_wial2pQjQRHZYJmy3ZKNo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CS1FXeFVWbTVrTUZRNFRuWjJPRmx3ZFhGRlRFRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The food and service were average, and the space was rather small. The restaurant seems to primarily focus on delivery orders. There\u0027s no restroom inside, which is something that could be improved.\n\nThe chicken and pork chops were decent, nothing special. I wouldn\u0027t recommend the crispy chicken! It\u0027s mostly skin; there\u0027s very little meat inside – a disappointment!\n\nI wouldn\u0027t recommend the shrimp patties either; they were too soft and didn\u0027t seem very fresh. The golden kimchi was good! A small plate costs 40 yuan, so the price is subjective.\n\nOverall, I think if you live nearby, you can check it out, but don\u0027t bother making a special trip to the restaurant!\n\nOrdering two main dishes, a small shrimp patty, two hash browns, and a small plate of kimchi totaled 400 yuan, which is acceptable.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "餐點水準一般、服務一般、環境偏小\n店家大部分應該是以外送接單為主\n店內沒有廁所，這點建議可以改善。\n\n雞排和豬排我覺得還不錯吃，中規中矩\n卡拉脆雞不建議點！幾乎都在吃外皮，內部的肉實際非常少～～點這道有點算踩雷了！\n蝦排不建議點，吃起來口感很軟，感覺沒有很新鮮\n黃金泡菜不錯吃！ㄧ小碟40元，價格見仁見智囉！\n\n整體吃起來我覺得住附近的話可以前往吃看看，但不用特地大老遠跑一趟到店家！\n\n單點兩個主餐、單點蝦排、兩個薯餅、一小碟泡菜，總共$400，尚可接受～～",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "阿明",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110820760541184274999/reviews",
