                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-12-03T14:09:35.179661169Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CS1FXeFVWbTVrTUZRNFRuWjJPRmx3ZFhGRlRFRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CS1FXeFVWbTVrTUZRNFRuWjJPRmx3ZFhGRlRFRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442a95d6a22fc07:0xda28d92d9b09961d"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJB_wial2pQjQRHZYJmy3ZKNo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaQ1oycEJabFpGZGxRMWJrWnpha3BMYXpCbFZWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Affordable, generous portions, and simple, unpretentious flavors. The menu offers a wide variety of dishes, such as tonkatsu (fried pork cutlet) bowls, beef bowls, and yakiniku (grilled meat), all of a decent standard. Most importantly, it\u0027s filling, making it perfect for a quick meal after work or a late-night snack. The ambiance is clean, though not fancy, and the food is served relatively quickly. It\u0027s a great place for those who want a simple, satisfying meal without breaking the bank.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "平價、份量足、口味樸實不花俏。餐點選擇多，像炸豬排丼、牛丼、燒肉等都算有一定水準，重點是吃起來有飽足感，適合下班或宵夜時間快速解決一餐。環境不講究裝飾，但整體乾淨，出餐速度也算快。是一家適合想吃得簡單、不想花太多錢又想吃飽的店。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "柏諺",
