                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJB_wial2pQjQRHZYJmy3ZKNo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sV05UUXdiR0Y1ZDJObk5teHRNa1Y2WVhZNU4zYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The donburi (rice bowl) was delicious, and the side dishes were also quite good. It\u0027s a small shop with a relaxed atmosphere and the music isn\u0027t too loud. However, it\u0027s not open until very late; it closes around 10 PM. I recommend it though. There are parking spaces on the street or in the parking lot of the nearby school.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "丼飯很好吃 有點的小菜也都不錯 小小的店 氣氛放鬆放鬆的 音樂不會太吵 不過是沒營業到真的很深夜 晚上10點差不多就關了 但推薦 路邊有停車位可以停 或者停旁邊學校的停車場",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
