                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sV05UUXdiR0Y1ZDJObk5teHRNa1Y2WVhZNU4zYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442a95d6a22fc07:0xda28d92d9b09961d"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJB_wial2pQjQRHZYJmy3ZKNo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMWMzQnRkblJ1ZGpkUVRFVkRhMkZGYURGYVJYYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We ordered takeout for lunch at work. When I went to pick it up, my colleagues had already finished theirs, and I only managed to take a picture of my own fried horse mackerel and scad donburi.\n\nI think if the donburi I ate was a 70, the one served on-site would definitely be an 85! The seaweed was soaked with steam; however, thankfully the batter for the fried fish and horse mackerel was still quite crispy, the fish was very fresh, and the fried horse mackerel had a moderate, not unpleasant, fishy smell! The egg broth, similar to oyako-don, soaked into the rice, and even after sitting for a while, it was still very appetizing. It would probably be even better eaten on-site. The portion of rice was also quite generous!\n\nUnanimously agreed to add it to our preferred order list!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "單位中午訂外送。我去拿午餐時，同事都已經嗑光了，只拍到我自己的炸竹莢魚雙魚丼。\n我覺得如果我吃的丼飯是70分，那現場應該會有85分！因為海苔絲都被熱氣浸濕了；不過還好炸魚塊與竹莢魚的麵衣還算酥爽，魚肉很新鮮，炸竹莢魚則有適度而不會讓人討厭的魚腥味！類似親子丼的雞蛋湯汁浸泡入白飯，放了一段時間這麼吃還是很下飯，如果是現場吃應該更讚。白飯份量也很足喔！\n一致同意列入點餐優選名單！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
